                                                "sense_id": "1738fdec-2523-3a56-bbc5-e72b5772c05b",
                                                "text": "Towns fell to him like so many houses of cards; and the fall of each town represented not only an accession to the prestige of the Royalist commander but a physical accession of strength as the wobblers flocked to the successful army."
                                            }
                                        ]
